    <briefdescription>
<para>Square-root stochastic-volatility Heston process. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the square root stochastic volatility process governed by <formula id="346">\[ \begin{array}{rcl} dS(t, S) &amp;=&amp; \mu S dt + \sqrt{v} S dW_1 \\ dv(t, S) &amp;=&amp; \kappa (\theta - v) dt + \sigma \sqrt{v} dW_2 \\ dW_1 dW_2 &amp;=&amp; \rho dt \end{array} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
